Second boot of the A/B image on hardware, 2026-10-28, image built from 520f1aa (sdcard.img
SHA-256 69f8d6b4369095d96bd55eeed88c5e5246c49abd13dc28777ed9efb157a3e77d), after the RTC
driver was built in and the health check's slot lookup was fixed. Console capture by the
user; the bracketed prefix is the capturing terminal's own clock (UTC+7).

EXCERPT: the lines that bear on T046 (ota-clock) and T027 (ota-health). Kernel messages
between 0.000 and 6.4 s and device-driver noise are omitted, nothing else is edited.
The first boot, which failed both, is t046-t027-first-hardware-boot.log.

